        1       *================================================================*
        2       * PROGRAMA : LUHNVALD (SUBPROGRAMA)                              *
        3       * AULA     : 9 - MODULARIZACAO                                   *
        4       * OBJETIVO : VALIDAR O DIGITO VERIFICADOR DO NUMERO DO CARTAO    *
        5       *            PELO ALGORITMO DE LUHN. EXTRAIDO DO FATCLASS.       *
        6       * CHAMADA  : CALL 'LUHNVALD' USING LK-AREA-LUHN (COPY CPLUHN)    *
        7       * RETORNO  : LK-RESULTADO = 'S' (VALIDO) OU 'N' (INVALIDO)       *
        8       *================================================================*
        9        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       10        PROGRAM-ID. LUHNVALD.
       11 
       12        DATA DIVISION.
       13        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       14        01  WS-LUHN-CARTAO             PIC X(16).
       15        01  WS-LUHN-DIGITOS REDEFINES WS-LUHN-CARTAO.
       16            05  WS-LUHN-DIGITO         PIC 9(01) OCCURS 16 TIMES.
       17        01  WS-LUHN-POS                PIC 9(02).
       18        01  WS-LUHN-PARCELA            PIC 9(02).
       19        01  WS-LUHN-SOMA               PIC 9(03).
       20        01  WS-LUHN-DOBRAR             PIC X(01).
       21            88  WS-LUHN-DOBRA                    VALUE 'S'.
       22            88  WS-LUHN-NAO-DOBRA                VALUE 'N'.
       23 
       24        LINKAGE SECTION.
       25            COPY CPLUHN.
       26 
       27        PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-AREA-LUHN.
       28        0000-PRINCIPAL.
       29            SET LK-CARTAO-INVALIDO TO TRUE
       30            MOVE LK-NUM-CARTAO     TO WS-LUHN-CARTAO
       31            IF WS-LUHN-CARTAO IS NOT NUMERIC
       32               GOBACK
       33            END-IF
       34            MOVE ZERO              TO WS-LUHN-SOMA
       35            SET WS-LUHN-NAO-DOBRA  TO TRUE
       36            PERFORM VARYING WS-LUHN-POS FROM 16 BY -1
       37                    UNTIL WS-LUHN-POS < 1
       38               MOVE WS-LUHN-DIGITO(WS-LUHN-POS) TO WS-LUHN-PARCELA
       39               IF WS-LUHN-DOBRA
       40                  COMPUTE WS-LUHN-PARCELA = WS-LUHN-PARCELA * 2
       41                  IF WS-LUHN-PARCELA > 9
       42                     SUBTRACT 9 FROM WS-LUHN-PARCELA
       43                  END-IF
       44                  SET WS-LUHN-NAO-DOBRA TO TRUE
       45               ELSE
       46                  SET WS-LUHN-DOBRA     TO TRUE
       47               END-IF
       48               ADD WS-LUHN-PARCELA TO WS-LUHN-SOMA
       49            END-PERFORM
       50            IF FUNCTION MOD(WS-LUHN-SOMA, 10) = ZERO
       51               SET LK-CARTAO-VALIDO TO TRUE
       52            END-IF
       53            GOBACK.
